  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37a62f2c2a9454b128bfaf20631070a6, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc: m\u1ED9t bi
    t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng cho c\u1EA3
    hai; kh\xF4ng quy \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE9ng bi m\xE0u n\xE0o ph\u1EA3i l\xE0m
    vi\u1EC7c. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P16 + P22 \u2014 hai bi \u1EDF s\xE2n ri\xEAng; cam
    m\u1ED9t n\u1EA5c m\u1EDF m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng chung, kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n
    gi\u1EEF t\u1EA3i li\xEAn t\u1EE5c.\nRecovery: Cam gi\u1EEF tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i
    khi bi r\u1EDDi \u0111i; bi \u0111\u1EA7u tho\xE1t kh\xF4ng khi\u1EBFn bi sau
    b\u1ECB kh\xF3a; m\u1ED7i s\xE2n c\xF3 t\xFAi gi\u1EEF r\u1ED9ng"
